   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "How it works: path → segments → labels",
   "originalText": "How it works: path → segments → labels",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a05-text-11",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 166,
   "width": 373,
   "height": 24,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 87109,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1152019,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Step 1. Post-convergence path (B14)",
   "originalText": "Step 1. Post-convergence path (B14)",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a05-text-12",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 200,
   "width": 972,
   "height": 43,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 95028,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1256748,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Remove link S–E (both ways), run SPF from S: S → A → B → C → E, cost 13. This is where S sends traffic\nafter the network reconverges, so traffic moves only once.",
   "originalText": "Remove link S–E (both ways), run SPF from S: S → A → B → C → E, cost 13. This is where S sends traffic\nafter the network reconverges, so traffic moves only once.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a05-text-13",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 253,
   "width": 352,
   "height": 24,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 102947,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1361477,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Step 2. Greedy segment walk (B15)",
   "originalText": "Step 2. Greedy segment walk (B15)",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a05-text-14",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 287,
   "width": 943,
   "height": 64,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 110866,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1466206,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Only S has switched. Every other router still uses its old table, and a Prefix-SID follows the old\ntable. So from each point, jump to the furthest router Y on the path where (a) dist(X,Y) equals the\npath cost and (b) every old path X → Y avoids S–E:  dist(X,Y) < dist(X,S) + c(S,E) + dist(E,Y).",
   "originalText": "Only S has switched. Every other router still uses its old table, and a Prefix-SID follows the old\ntable. So from each point, jump to the furthest router Y on the path where (a) dist(X,Y) equals the\npath cost and (b) every old path X → Y avoids S–E:  dist(X,Y) < dist(X,S) + c(S,E) + dist(E,Y).",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a05-text-15",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 361,
   "width": 692,
   "height": 180,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 118785,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1570935,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "From  Try  (a) dist = path cost?  (b) avoids S–E?        Segment\n----  ---  ---------------------  ---------------------  ---------------\nS     E    1 ≠ 13  ✗\nS     C    2 ≠ 12  ✗\nS     B    2 = 2   ✓              2 < 0 + 1 + 3 = 4  ✓   PrefixSID(B)\nB     E    3 ≠ 11  ✗\nB     C    4 ≠ 10  ✗   B’s old path B→A→S→E→C uses S–E\n                       no Prefix-SID works             →  AdjSID(B→C)\nC     E    1 = 1   ✓              1 < 2 + 1 + 0 = 3  ✓   PrefixSID(E)",
   "originalText": "From  Try  (a) dist = path cost?  (b) avoids S–E?        Segment\n----  ---  ---------------------  ---------------------  ---------------\nS     E    1 ≠ 13  ✗\nS     C    2 ≠ 12  ✗\nS     B    2 = 2   ✓              2 < 0 + 1 + 3 = 4  ✓   PrefixSID(B)\nB     E    3 ≠ 11  ✗\nB     C    4 ≠ 10  ✗   B’s old path B→A→S→E→C uses S–E\n                       no Prefix-SID works             →  AdjSID(B→C)\nC     E    1 = 1   ✓              1 < 2 + 1 + 0 = 3  ✓   PrefixSID(E)",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a05-text-16",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 551,
   "width": 213,
   "height": 24,
